{"content":{"blocks":[{"caller":{"type":"direct"},"id":"toolu_01GDjiLSwHt3VNNVUM91Txcc","input":{"command":"git add -A && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nAdapter drift: revert the auto-drafted PR, keep reporting-only\n\nReverts the draft-PR job added in 53a1973. Keeps the two parts of it that\nstand on their own: closing the tracking issue when drift clears, and an\nissue checklist that names the headless probes rather than only the\ninteractive smoke test.\n\nThe draft PR saved a one-line pin edit while the real work — running the\nprobes locally — was unchanged. What it cost was worse than that trade:\nCI cannot validate a pin, so the PR asserted, in mergeable form, a\nvalidation nobody had performed. An issue cannot be merged. That\nasymmetry is the argument, and it applies just as much to the\nagent-drafted variant, whose blocker was never the ANTHROPIC_API_KEY but\nthe per-provider model credentials the probes need.\n\nWorkflow is back to `permissions: contents: read` with no repo writes.\nRationale recorded in the workflow header and the roadmap so the idea\ndoesn't get rebuilt from scratch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011JgcSa7vJyxAN7FEEDxgwZ\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -3 && git push 2>&1 | tail -2","description":"Commit revert and push","timeout":120000},"name":"Bash","type":"tool_use"}],"role":"assistant"},"context":{"branch":"worktree-codex-0146-revalidation","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/turnbridge/.claude/worktrees/codex-0146-revalidation","head":"af10387da6e931adbcafb122b1101579c6dc90d8","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/turnbridge.git"},"id":"ev2-e5eb2dd19675a2e7a5973d1718a74b01e110815cd4ae30c567fd0a46bdd746c6","kind":"conversation_turn","meta":{"actor":{"id":"claude-opus-5","type":"agent"},"model":"claude-opus-5","session_id":"9892ff2b-b3e3-4a51-8eb8-a37bb79d2137","source":"claude-code","source_version":"2.1.220"},"occurred_at":"2026-08-03T04:01:58.693Z",