{"content":{"blocks":[{"text":"You're right, and I built the former — a draft PR that widens the pin but validates nothing. Let me make the case against my own choice, because your instinct catches something I underweighted.\n\nThe mechanical PR saves a one-line edit you could type in seconds, while the actual work — running the probes locally — is unchanged. For that it costs `contents: write` on CI and a PR to manage. But the real problem is worse than low value: **an issue can't be merged, and a PR can.** A draft sitting there saying \"widen the pin,\" with a green diff and no way for CI to prove anything, is exactly the artifact that gets merged on a busy day. It moves an unvalidated pin one click from shipping. That's a genuine hazard the issue simply doesn't have.\n\nReverting to issue-only.","type":"text"}],"role":"assistant"},"context":{"branch":"worktree-codex-0146-revalidation","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/turnbridge/.claude/worktrees/codex-0146-revalidation","head":"af10387da6e931adbcafb122b1101579c6dc90d8","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/turnbridge.git"},"id":"ev2-76e4f671a1e0a52e0967284eecbbd84bdfea8d09e985a5a0b3e21deb9d4881db","kind":"conversation_turn","meta":{"actor":{"id":"claude-opus-5","type":"agent"},"model":"claude-opus-5","session_id":"9892ff2b-b3e3-4a51-8eb8-a37bb79d2137","source":"claude-code","source_version":"2.1.220"},"occurred_at":"2026-08-03T04:00:54.174Z","producer":{"tool":"cledger","version":"0.16.0"},"raw":{"data":{"cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/turnbridge/.claude/worktrees/codex-0146-revalidation","effort":"high","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"worktree-codex-0146-revalidation","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"text":"You're right, and I built the former — a draft PR that widens the pin but validates nothing. Let me make the case against my own choice, because your instinct catches something I underweighted.\n\nThe mechanical PR saves a one-line edit you could type in seconds, while the actua